  "reuseGuidance": "Default card grid for product/category teasers. Structural options: image/image-* (photo above text), horizontal/horizontal-2 (photo beside text), photo-overlay/photo-overlay-2/photo-overlay-audience(-2) (text over full-bleed photo), header-strip/header-strip-blue-grey (first short cell becomes a coloured label bar), featured (first card wide), tiers (stacked rate rows), apply (single CTA panel with image beside text). Colour options (tinted, alt, blue, orange, red-light, cyan-red, grey, light, shadow, etc.) are styling hooks for the design pass. Use cards-plan for priced plan comparisons and cards-article for editorial teasers."
